["MiniEventFungusStory_1"]="It looks like there's nobody underground but us. But don't be fooled. You can't hear them, but they're the true masters of the earth. Mushrooms.",
["MiniEventFungusStory_2"]="Their father Fungus sees and knows everything. His eyes are everywhere. And only we stand between him and his control over a world where humans are but fertile soil.",
["MiniEventFungusFight_Enter_1"]="My brothers found some kind of mushroom in a distant tunnel... Now my brothers are no more. We must put out the eyes of this pest! Attack!",
["MiniEventFungus_Win_1"]="Listen to the hum of the dungeon, Shadow. Do you hear anything else? Exactly, silence... My brothers can rest in peace now...",
["MiniEventFungus_Win_2"]="We can walk these tunnels again without always being on our guard, Shadow. But in future we promise to take more care planning our routes. Nobody else will suffer.",
["MiniEventFungus_Loss_1"]="Look around! Can't you feel the stifling clouds of fungus spores?! Thanks to you, our kind will become fertilizer for a colony of mushrooms! Curse you...",
["MiniEventFungus_Loss_2"]="One day nature will win, Shadow. I can feel that in this musty air. But we won't be the cause of it, not today. Get up! We'll fight for our land!",
