["dlgHW22StoryPuppeteer_1"]="There comes a knock, an unexpected knock at your door! Is that a traveler come to call, or something more? Intriguing?",
["dlgHW22StorySensei_1"]="Whatever you dreamed up, Puppeteer, we won't be playing your games anymore. Art can cause pain, but not the way you do it.",
["dlgHW22StoryPuppeteer_2"]="I knew you'd say that, old man. What else can one expect from invented characters? Still, paper will bear anything... But the audience never will!",
["dlgHW22StorySensei_2"]="You've acted too much and can no longer differentiate between reality and your fantasies, performer... You're insane.",
["dlgHW22StoryPuppeteer_3"]="I'm just a slave to the stage, that's all. And my new masterpiece will tell of a meeting with the creator! About the torments of predestination and free will...",
["dlgHW22StoryArchitect_1"]="That's what's called a \"cliché\", Puppeteer. What are playwrights paid for? For the number of symbols? The figure of the babbling mad genius has grown stale now, like the figure of the hero...",
["dlgHW22StoryArchitect_2"]="That's it. We'll rewrite your world from scratch! Contemporary, creative, relevant! What are the teenagers into these days? Why don't you say anything, Shadow? Oh, yes...",
["dlgHW22StorySensei_3"]="Your words are peculiar and worrying, stranger... I don't know what craziness is going on in your head, but Shadow will knock it out of you.",
["dlgHW22LooseArchitect_1"]="That was to be expected. I know all of your moves, Shadow. After all, I was the one who invented you. Perhaps I was off my game at the time... But now you'll like your new life.",
["dlgHW22LooseSensei_1"]="You aren't bound by the fetters of fate, Shadow. You can create your destiny yourself! Whether he's our creator or not, you can decide for yourself who to be. Stand up and fight!",
["dlgHW22WinArchitect_1"]="Perhaps the creation no longer belongs to its creator and has taken on a life of its own... You have surprised me. I want to see where the story goes next.",
["dlgHW22WinShadow_1"]="This is my life, and not your twisted script, Architect!",
["dlgHW22WinSensei_1"]="Wait... How can that be?! You're speaking?",
["dlgHW22WinArchitect_2"]="You see? Everything's possible in the creator's head. Live and learn. I have great plans for you...",
["dlgHW22WinPuppeteer_1"]="Leave my loneliness unbroken... Where... do I know these words from? Never mind! The actors are taking their bows!",
["dlgHW22EnterArchitect"]="All this fantasy narrative of yours has exhausted me… Now we're going to play by my rules. And it's in your interest to surprise me, Shadow…",
