["MiniEventHungerStory_1"]="The people care about the whims of the spirits only when trouble descends on their homes. Their crops perish, their children go hungry… And where is their faith now?",
["MiniEventHungerStory_2"]="Hunger has a form. Its thirst to consume is terrible. But that's Karcer's role, while yours and mine is to prevent him from waking from his centuries-old slumber.",
["MiniEventHungerFight_Enter_1"]="Here beneath the earth, everything is different. We fight to live, and grub is life! Don't deprive your and my people of this great joy!",
["MiniEventHunger_Win_1"]="Yes, you strike well, Shadow… Let's celebrate your victory with some hearty chow! My treat!",
["MiniEventHunger_Win_2"]="I hear a contented rumbling from the depths of the dungeon. The insatiable spirit sleeps again, full and content. The harvest will be plentiful this year! Thank you, Shadow.",
["MiniEventHunger_Loss_1"]="Didn't your mother teach you not to leave anything on your plate? It shows – there's hunger in your eyes! Or… what is the matter with you?",
["MiniEventHunger_Loss_2"]="The hungry eyes of the children speak volumes, Shadow. Your weakness brings the end of everything. Can your conscience bear the weight? Get up and fight!",
["WEAPON_MINI_EVENT_KNIFE"]="Insatiable Blades",
["dlgNY23StoryMay_1"]="I've only seen the sky illuminated like that in the far north... Nature itself seems to be frozen by such a miracle! I'm worried, Sensei, it's a bad sign...",
["dlgNY23StoryFreez_Jn_1"]="The world is freezing in anticipation of the cold. Time itself doesn't want to move forward. It and the winter frost have so much in common, don't you think?",
["dlgNY23StorySensei_1"]="You're afraid of something that's as natural as the changing of the seasons. But you yourself are part of this process and you must understand what it means! Think...",
["dlgNY23StoryFreez_Jn_2"]="No, it's a benefit! Working with the elements, I realized that time is as malleable as water and fire. Then I had an idea...",
["dlgNY23StoryFreez_Jn_3"]="My father is old and sick. It hurts to see how time passes, and with it will pass his invaluable experience. I can correct that! I can stop the passing of time!",
["dlgNY23StoryFreez_Jn_4"]="I'm not afraid of eternity, old man. Eternity is my friend now. You'll like it. You'll have all the time in the world to find that out...",
["dlgNY23LooseFreez_1"]="You don't realize what a gift I'm giving you! All our meetings have led to this moment! I'm giving you eternal life, so just be grateful.",
["dlgNY23LooseSensei_1"]="Only when you lose something do you understand its true value. That's what you're depriving us of, Freeze! You're depriving yourself too, and that's why you'll be defeated!",
["dlgNY23WinFreez_1"]="Curious... I didn't realize that pain would last forever in static time. What an interesting effect...",
["dlgNY23WinMay_1"]="You're prepared to upend the foundations of creation rather than be left on your own. I understand. That's more frightening for you than any punishment. But there is another way.",
["dlgNY23WinSensei_1"]="Be the one to continue your father's work. Carry this standard with honor, young Freeze. For winter to come again, we need this turn around the sun.",
["dlgNY23WinFreez_2"]="I think I understand what you're saying, old man. My father will be glad to hear that his work is in good hands. We'll meet again—next time as friends, I hope.",
["NYEvent23Announce"]="The young lord of the frost Freeze Jr. is growing up fast, and with him grow his atrocities. Driven by the fear of being alone, he discovers the power of time, which could help him to save his father from aging. However, time won't tolerate such an attitude...",
