["saturn_greeting_saimon_1"]="Our ruler, the Patriarch, studied the portal for years. Then, one day, he withdrew into himself. Later, he put up the Obelisk, and it did something to our world...",
["saturn_greetingn_May_1"]="But what's that got to do with us?",
["saturn_greeting_saimon_2"]="Shadow is similar to the Obelisk on a molecular level. There's a person who will help to use that against the Patriarch. And that's why we're here in the chamber of Saturn...",
["saturn_greeting_saturn_1"]="Going far, kids? You came to my prison of your own free will! I wonder, is that bravery or stupidity? You, the lanky one, answer!",
["saturn_greeting_saimon_3"]="A thousand apologies, my lady. However, we must free Lazarus. Please show us to his cell, and we won't dare to bother you any further.",
["saturn_enter_saturn_1"]="I'll ram your words back down your throat. And your friends will watch. The only way to leave my prison is via the scaffold. Who wants to go first?",
["saturn_lose_saturn_1"]="That's enough for you. If Lazarus is associating with rejects like you, there's no danger to the Patriarch. Get out of here, brats! You're not on my list.",
["saturn_win_saturn_1"]="You'll never find Lazarus. That rascal escaped from my prison and hid in the marshes. You want to perish too? Then off you go after him!",
["saturn_win_saimon_1"]="You mean, he escaped his punishment... and wrapped you around his little finger? How marvelous! The Patriarch should be more careful choosing his minions.",
["saturn_win_May_1"]="What's out there on the marshes? Saturn speaks fearfully of them. If a fierce warrior like her didn't set off in pursuit of a dangerous fugitive...",
["saturn_win_saturn_2"]="Orders are orders, but my life is still dear to me. Besides, those rebels are not threat to the Patriarch without their leader. They're just a rabble. Urgh!",
["saturn_win_sensei"]="In that case, our road leads to the marshes. I hope Lazarus will tell us how Shadow is connected to the Obelisk and why the Patriarch condemned this world to death.",
