["blackness_greeting_may_1"]="Hear that? Nothing! Silence. Without birdsong, it's as if this place is frozen in amber. Are we doing the right thing? I have a very bad feeling... ",
["blackness_greetingn_saimon_1"]="No wonder. Ever since a piece of the ancient Gates crashed here, life in this place has been a statistical error. Keep your eyes open, we need to find Lazarus.",
["blackness_greeting_lazarus_2"]="Simon? What a bastard you are! Why did you bring people here? It'll catch the scent of your thoughts! Get away from here before the Blackness gets a taste of your thoughts! ",
["blackness_greeting_saimon_2"]="These wonderful gentlemen are your ticket to freedom, my dear. The big guy in black is connected somehow to the Obelisk and the Gates. He helps you, and you help him.",
["blackness_greeting_blackness_1"]="What's the matter, Shadow? Are you sick?",
["blackness_enter_blackness_1"]="Offspring. A great sacrifice. A sphere. The mind. Butchery. I feel. You will spill blood. I see pain. I see the future. I'll show you.",
["blackness_lose_blackness_1"]="You stay here. Eternally. One blood. Forever. I will read you. I will feed.",
["blackness_lose_saimon_1"]="I don't like it that somebody's taking my will away, my dear! It's an offense to my intellect! Shadow, you have to get us out of here!",
["blackness_win_may_1"]="Whose form has it taken? Does that tell you anything, Shadow? It was definitely speaking to you. I'm getting chills like I saw a ghost...",
["blackness_win_lazarus_1"]="One blood, of course! Thank you for returning me a part of myself. This is where our paths diverge. Now they will pay. Stupid, insignificant people!",
["blackness_win_saimon_1"]="Wait, my dear! This isn't what we agreed! Unnecessary victims are unacceptable! You're upset, I understand, but let go your emotions... And engage your brain!",
["blackness_win_sensei"]="You lied to us, man of science! Who did we free? What have we condemned this world to? Do you realize what you've done?! ",
["blackness_win_saimon_2"]="I made a mistake in my calculations... We have to get to the city before Lazarus razes it to the ground along with the Patriarch! The innocent will suffer! Let's go!",
