["dlgFreezOldNY24_Story1"]="You moron! What do you think you're doing, Junior?! C'mon, drop that shooting stick before you get yourself hurt! And what've you got in that sack?",
["dlgFreezJnNY24_Story1"]="It's a musket, father. A human weapon. Just wait 'til you hear it boom! Just like the cracking of a February frost! Bang!",
["dlgFreezOldNY24_Story2"]="Stop your childishness! This is no toy! Who gave you that dangerous weapon, son? Did you steal it? Take it by force?",
["dlgFreezJnNY24_Story2"]="Somebody saw potential in my time magic, unlike you! We didn't steal a thing! We were just working together… To help!",
["dlgSenseiJnNY24_Story2"]="Getting into trouble again, young Freeze? Taking things from your time like that could cause a paradox! Tell me the name of whoever put you up to this!",
["dlgFreezOldNY24_Story3"]="Stand aside, old timer. Don't raise my son for me. I see kind words won't get me anywhere. I won't ask again: who was with you?",
["dlgFreezJnNY24_Story3"]="You have no imagination, Father. A lot of things that can help people have been lost in time. And we can make a little money off it. Is that such a bad thing?",
["dlgFreezOldNY24_Story4"]="If you won't play by my rules, son, I'll take that sack of yours and lock it away until next year…",
["dlgSenseiJnNY24_Story_loose_win"]="As much as I'd like to keep this between you, we must interfere. Father and son have nothing to share. Shadow, however, can put the youngster in his place.",
["dlgSenseiJnNY24_loose_Shadow"]="Shadow, take that sack from Junior before time fractures!",
["dlgFreezJnNY24_Win1"]="It was all Sly! He promised he'd give me the musket as long as I got these things for him. And the sack holds an anomaly that prevents time rifts! Relax!",
["dlgFreezOldNY24_Win1"]="Sly, huh? That cunning devil… Didn't he explain to you that you could wipe us from the pages of history just by stepping on some flower?! ",
["dlgSenseiJnNY24_Win1"]="Correct. Time, as you may have realized, is deceptive. Treacherous. Stop it, and the world simply holds its breath, but change it, and you'll lose your very self.",
["dlgFreezOldNY24_Win2"]="Come, my son. Tell me about the times you've seen. And I'll listen, something I've never done before. We'll find a solution together. ",
["dlgHunter_greeting_saimon_1"]="How strange… I was expecting Lazarus to flatten the Obelisk to dust. I was afraid to see the carnage, but it seems that only you and I are here. I'm intrigued.",
["dlgHunter_greeting_sensei_1"]="Silence is a bad omen, my rational friend. It can say more than the loudest of words. Hmm, where are we? What is this bizarre place?",
["dlgHunter_greeting_saimon_2"]="The Concentration Hall. You see that crystal in the center? That's how the Obelisk accumulates shadow energy. The heart of darkness, so to speak.",
["dlgHunter_greeting_may_1"]="Look! There's something inside the crystal… Is it meant to be like that?",
["dlgHunter_greeting_sensei_2"]="I doubt that, my dear… This place looks different from how I saw it last. I'm beginning to think the old man was right…",
["dlgHunter_enter_hunter_1"]="You! Hey, yooou! Come to finish what you staaarted, huh? You? There's a power to you. It ssspeaks to me. Hush! Or I'll maaake you!",
["dlgHunter_loose_hunter_1"]="Lay dooown. I'll leeeeave you here foreveeeer. Don't cause mooore harm. ",
["dlgHunter_sensei_loose_1"]="Stay with us, Shadow! ",
["dlgHunter_win_hunter_1"]="Stop, Shadow-human! Don't let it ssssspreeeeaad! You'll beee like hiiiiiiiim. You shall be decccceived! But you still have a chaaaanccce.",
["dlgHunter_win_saimon_1"]="What the helium?! The Imperial ring! My friends, we just… overthrew the Patriarch. So what, \"Long live the king?\"",
["dlgHunter_win_may_1"]="Did Lazarus do that to him? Why did we free his spirit in that forest…",
["dlgHunter_win_saimon_2"]="A son wouldn't raise his hand against his father. No, this is far more complicated… Shadow? You don't look so good. Can you hear me? How. Man-; Fing; Holdin; Up? You…",
["dlgHunter_win_voice_1"]="Hello, Shadow. Finally, we can speak in private. Did you miss me, brother?",
