["NY24Greetings"]="The Shadow Fight 2 team wishes you a happy New Year!May the coming year be full of exciting events, just like the journey of our heroes.We wish you new friends, wise decisions, and resounding victories!",
["MAGIC_CYBER_DRAGON_RAY"]="Isotope Reactor",
