["dlgOfferCyberDragon"]="The unique Cyber Dragon pack! Hurry, this offer is limited!",
["dlgCNY24_Story_Sensei1"]="Have our paths crossed before? I daresay I've already beheld those dazzling rays of yours... Say, don't our faces tell you anything?",
["dlgCNY24_Story_Sun2"]="I... I'm the Sun Lord, shepherd of my people! Must a higher being remember all the common rabble? Do you dare engage in combat with a living god?",
["dlgCNY24_Story_Sensei2"]="Of course, my Lord, of course. Only it seems that you went by another name the last time we met—Son of the Sun. Did that slip your mind?",
["dlgCNY24_Story_Sun3"]="Uh... yes, quite right! I was merely testing you, human! I demand a duel to entertain our esteemed audience! They're watching us, and they hunger for a show! ",
["dlgCNY24_Story_Sensei3"]="Something doesn't add up here. The Son of the Sun is poised and mannered. You simply look like him. Leave our dwelling before Shadow boxes your ears.",
["dlgCNY24_Story_Sun4"]="No, old man, I cannot do that. Only one shall be left standing after this battle. And it won't be that silent bully of yours. Attack!",
["dlgCNY24_Story_Loose_Sun"]="I can't believe I did it! I took down that beast with my own hands! Uh, I mean... Never cross a god, mortal! Open your soul to the Sun!",
["dlgCNY24_Story_Loose_Sensei"]="Shadow, he's drenched in sweat! He's tired too! How does that old saying go? \"I regard nothing human as foreign to me,\" right? How in the... You must teach this imposter a lesson! Get up!",
["dlgCNY24_Story_Win_Sun"]="No, I can't lose! They won't set me free! Just let me win! Pretend, and I'll pay you back! Please...",
["dlgCNY24_Story_Win_Sensei"]="It's high time to dispel this illusion. You keep glancing around. Who are you afraid of? Who's watching us? ",
["dlgCNY24_Story__Sun2"]="The Sun Cult. They believe me to be their deity. We're just alike... I adored all the attention, but now this deception is going to cost me dearly...",
["dlgCNY24_Story_Sensei2"]="We'll find the real Son of the Sun before his people stir up trouble. Tell no more lies, stranger, and we will protect you. Tell us everything about this cult.",
["WEAPON_CNY2024"]="Sunstroke",
["HELM_CNY2024_MASK"]="Daybreak's Visage",
["MAGIC_CNY2024"]="Star's Breath",
["KeyCNY24"]="Prayer Shard",
