["FUNGUS_SET_TITLE"]="Spore Soul",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Puppet_1"]="Knock, knock! Hey, old friends! This is the voice of fate, and she is on her way! Her red hem smolders like life itself at the end of the day!",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Puppet_2"]="Is it for your soul that she's here? Look now upon a tale as ancient as the world itself — the legend of Nrityu, whose fate it was to be a taker of lives.",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Sensei_1"]="That voice... It appears that our old adversary is up to something again. Who will be the victim this time? I see a man running towards the pagoda...",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Dandy_1"]="Open up or I'll break down this damn door! I know you're home! I can hear you! I'll put this shack to flames if you don't grant me shelter!",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Sensei_2"]="Your clothes are covered in filth and soot, stranger. And your tone makes me uneasy. Explain who you are and what you're doing at our doorstep!",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Puppet_3"]="The ghosts are all chattering. You can't trust them. And besides, it's not their story. I'll show you the truth through her eyes. Shadow, you're the only one who can understand. ",
["dlgIndia24_Enter_Nrityu_1"]="The moon is particularly cold tonight. She's deaf to your pleas, villain. You have taken lives, and now I will take yours! Nobody will cry for you!",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Loose_Nrityu_1"]="Oh, how fiercely mortals cling to life. It wasn't me who chose this work, and I won't shed my venomous tears over it... Why have you done this to me?",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Loose_Puppet_1"]="But the creator says nothing. He gave her the crown of death itself, and now every mortal — good or bad — sees her face at the very end. She continues.",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Win_Nrityu_1"]="There! You fall into eternal sleep, although you don't deserve it. But it's not for me to judge you. That is another's calling. I am but the escort. ",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Win_Puppet_1"]="Nrityu looks around. Dandy wasn't alone. Behind the trees hides the girl who made the mistake. It was her who lit the flames. Was it out of fear?",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Win_Nrityu_2"]="Your thoughts are jumbled, Faradeya. I hear the voices in your head. They torment and lead you into doubt. You're tired. You want peace. I will give it to you.",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Win_Faradeya_1"]="Get back! I didn't want this! My family was afraid of me, and I thought this was my chance... Dandy promised to take me with him, if I helped...",
["dlgIndia24_Enter_Nrityu_2"]="I can read you like an open book. Your fear brings sadness to my heart. But your time has come, girl. I'd like to put down my blade but I can't.",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Loose_Nrityu_2"]="A cornered little creature... In moments of misery, you call my name, but at the end you refuse to accept my gift. Cast off your fear and come with me!",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Loose_Puppet_2"]="Her heart is filled with love. The gods create us pure, but we choose our own path. Nrityu begins to understand this as she listens to the girl's story.",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Win_Puppet_2"]="Faradeya breathes freely for the first time. Nrityu takes her by the hand and leads her away. The story is as eternal as creation itself. It will play out again.",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Win_Sensei_1"]="This story is deep even for you. I'm surprised! But what's the moral here? Why are you showing it to us? ",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Win_Puppet_3"]="Nrityu is tender-hearted, and nothing human is strange to her. She feels, she errs, she angers, but she does what fate would have her do.",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Win_Puppet_4"]="Just like you, Shadow. I want you to follow Nrityu's path. It took her an eternity to understand her place.",
["dlgIndia24_Enter_Puppet_1"]="Do you have the spirit required to direct fate? Decide mine, humble servant of the arts that I am. Only in combat do you understand what's what. Be bold, Shadow, attack!",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Loose_Puppet_3"]="Shadow, your performance has no passion or commitment to the part. I'll give you another chance. Don't act it, live it!",
["dlgIndia24_Story_Win_Puppet_6"]="The show goes on! You, Shadow, will be the star, and my actors will be your supporting players. The story of Nrityu will be our greatest production!",
["raid_battle_info_time"]="Disappears in:",
