["WEAPON_RAID_FUNGUS_SET"]="Guardian's Wrath",
["MiniEventVulkanStory_1"]="The cleansing fire is just. That's what our ancestors said. But they did not know that Immortals care not for human morality. That is the way they are.",
["MiniEventVulkanStory_2"]="Do you feel the heat coming from under the ground? There's just one thing you must know: the flame spares no one, be they friend or stranger. And we stand in its way.",
["MiniEventVulkanFight_Enter_1"]="The witch scares you without reason. It is much simpler than that: steel is tempered in fire! The gods understand power and nothing else. That alone can return them to their slumber! Attack!",
["MiniEventVulkan_Win_1"]="It's as hot as hellfire here... The fire spirit is growling contentedly in its vault! A fine fight indeed, Shadow! We have earned another day!",
["MiniEventVulkan_Win_2"]="You have paid tribute to the insatiable god, hero. I can feel it. The flame will go out, but the light that will illuminate the path of our descendants will burn only brighter.",
["MiniEventVulkan_Loss_1"]="You ought to get back on your feet, Shadow! Do you feel the ground quaking?! The god is disgusted by our messing around in the dirt...",
["MiniEventVulkan_Loss_2"]="I believe that the flame of your heart burns brighter than the crazed god's blind rage. And your time has come to shine your light on us, hero! Arise!",
["SetUi_FUNGUS_SET_Brief"]="This enchantment feeds on the enemy's pain. Just keep dealing damage until it's saturated. Once it's done absorbing enough pain, it'll spawn a spore in your enemy, which will infuse you with his life force.",
["KeyAE24"]="Beast Shard",
["dlgIndDay24_Announce"]="An ancient Indian tale comes to life before your eyes! An evil giant, once defeated by brave warriors, has found a way to come back to life with the help of spirits of the night. An army of monsters is already gathering at his grave, and only you can stop them! Become the new legend of the tribe!",
["dlgIndDay24_AnnounceTitle"]="Storm Warning",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_1"]="The weather is changing. I can feel it in my old bones. It's a bad omen. Storm winds never bring good tidings.",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_2"]="People talk all sorts of things. They say a whole wagon fell into a crevice recently! And the evil spirits are restless at night. They smell something...",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_3"]="We must stop meeting like this, but I have no one else to turn to. We have buried many stories of the old world, but there is one that will not rest.",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_4"]="It seems to me, young lady, this is one of those \"legends\" of your people, with sharp teeth and an incredible grudge against the entire human race.",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_5"]="The insatiable giant Giwakwa was once torn apart! But his spirit somehow escaped from the dungeon... The giant is weak, so he needs an army.",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_6"]="I will take you to the place where he gave up his spirit. The creatures of the night cannot resist his call; they will come after him to become his food.",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_7"]="The winds carried your scent to me before you ever set foot on the shore. This vessel is just a splinter of my greatness, but even it would be able to tear you apart!",
["dlgIndDay24_Loose_1"]="Shadow, remember that Giwakwa was once human. There's nothing divine about him, so he can be defeated. Get up!",
["dlgIndDay24_Loose_2"]="The moment the spirits put my body and soul together, there will be no end to our feast. Run as far away as you can! And maybe I won't find you when I'm saturated!",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_8"]="The storm is coming, Shadow! While you've been fighting, more creatures approached us! They seem to be afraid of you, waiting. Be ready!",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_9"]="The soul of that stupid animal wouldn't have gotten me back in shape anyway. But this one is more interesting... It can sense which way the wind blows! ",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_10"]="Giwakwa is a beast that understands the language of brute force. It's worth showing who the apex predator is, and then his bond with his minions will be weakened!",
["dlgIndDay24_Loose_3"]="There's a piece of my soul in each of these creatures. And it's begging to be set free! Bend down and I'll swallow you quickly!",
["dlgIndDay24_Loose_4"]="Do not trust the words of this impostor, Shadow! I feel hundreds of prying eyes staring at us. Any mercy, and the hordes will sweep in. Get up!",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_11"]="They're running! The spirits are retreating back into the forest! Their leader has stumbled!",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_12"]="Stop, you coward mutts! I gave you a reason to exist - to be part of something real! We've been united! And this is how you repay me?!",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_13"]="The possession is gone. And now the spirits sense their leader's humanity. Weak, wicked, self-righteous. ",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_14"]="And like any human considering himself a god, Giwakwa fell victim to his imperfect nature. And so will happen to anyone...",
["dlgIndDay24_Story_15"]="Thank you, Shadow! We have honored those who had fought the giant for centuries. Now they can rest in peace. The ancestors are proud of us. Their voices are fading.",
["dlgNewsNewTrailerTitle"]="NEW TRAILER",
["ENCHANTMENT_MAGMA"]="Roaring Luminary",
["VOLCANO_SET_TITLE"]="Abyss Mark",
["ARMOR_RAID_VOLCANO_SET"]="Ash Whisper ",
["HELM_RAID_VOLCANO_SET"]="Burning Wreath",
["MAGIC_RAID_FUNGUS_SET"]="Spores of Discord",
["dlgBerstuuk_Announce"]="Seeking forbidden knowledge, a gifted scientist has combined science and magic to become a god. And the transformation is inevitable! Now the forest is his nightmarish laboratory, and humans are his prey. Only you can stop this terrifying transformation! Banish your fear and go to the heart of the thicket in search of the false idol!",
["dlgBerstuuk_AnnounceTitle"]="Shadow of Eternity",
["dlgBerstuuk_Story_1"]="There's Sly outside knocking on the barn door... I've seen a lot in the forest at night, but that's something new! What's wrong with him?",
["dlgBerstuuk_Story_2"]="For those seeking help, the path leads to the right door. But Sly seems to have lost his way... You old rascal, watch your hands! What happened?",
["dlgBerstuuk_Story_3"]="The rascal was looking for help, and he found it. Let's come to the woods before it takes what's rightfully theirs. The lives of mens!",
["dlgBerstuuk_Story_4"]="\"Mens\"? Poor guy's in shock, he's got no face! What frightened him so much that he suddenly had a crisis of conscience?",
["dlgBerstuuk_Story_5"]="Can you hear the birds singing? At this hour they are already chirping, but here is nothing but dead silence... What else is lurking in this forest?",
["dlgBerstuuk_Story_6"]="Dead silence. Dead silence. Pple need hlp. You hve to he-e-lp. Hlp now!",
["dlgBerstuuk_Story_7"]="Wow! People normally don't turn into dry twigs and moss, no matter how frightened they are! What's that thing and where is the real Sly?!",
["dlgBerstuuk_Story_8"]="He's around here somewhere. Sly's little mind has been most helpful. He told me about you, Shadow, about your special power. And it hit me! ",
["dlgBerstuuk_Story_9"]="So you're the one the creature spoke of? The woods will come and take away. And how many of these \"rightful\" lives have you taken, madman?",
["dlgBerstuuk_Story_10"]="Not enough. Science is unpredictable - just look at me! Gradually I accepted the forest, but it kept refusing to accept me. Until now.",
["dlgBerstuuk_Loose_1"]="When you came to my door, you told me everything without words! I will pull this knowledge like a thin thread until there is nothing left!",
["dlgBerstuuk_Loose_2"]="Shadow, think of the lives he's already taken! Let their sacrifice not be in vain! Get up!",
["dlgBerstuuk_Win_1"]="Nature will find a way! Our fight has told me more than you realize, Shadow. The forest will remember. It'll consume me to revive again...",
["dlgBerstuuk_Win_2"]="Here we go again, twigs and moss! I'll think twice before taking a shortcut through the forest from now on. And where's Sly? Is he...",
["dlgBerstuuk_Win_3"]="He's not here. Just withering. Men like him don't disappear without a trace, for their love for themselves is so strong. We shall see him again.",
["dlgBerstuuk_Win_4"]="He was so real... When I heard the creature calling for help, I thought for a moment that Sly might think of someone other than himself. ",
["dlgBerstuuk_Win_5"]="Indeed, you can see all sorts of bizarre things in the woods at night.",
["RAIDBOSS_BERSTUUK_TITLE"]="Berstuuk",
["RAIDBOSS_BERSTUUK"]="BERSTUUK",
["WEAPON_SICKLE_FALL_24"]="False Gods",
["WEAPON_SCYTHE_FALL_24"]="Hope Eater",
["HELM_FALL_24"]="Poisonеd Wisdom",
["KeyFall_24"]="Amber Firefly",
["ChestFall_24"]="Distorted Prophecy",
["tutorial_ascension_into_1"]="What an interesting face! Ever thought of being a stage actor? My theater is always in need of actors. For a handsome compensation...",
["tutorial_ascension_into_2"]="Do we know each other? You're confused, 'cause I tour a lot! In every production, the audience sees themselves. That's the magic of theater!",
["tutorial_ascension_into_3"]="Here's your backstage pass. Come boldly into my abode of high art! But remember, everyone wants to be a star, but only a few become one!",
["ascension_story1_1"]="Now for the rehearsal! The first story is as old as time itself. Maybe you've heard it before. So no need for costumes, just pure acting!",
["ascension_story1_2"]="There was a kind monk who protected travelers from the darkness of the forest, for which he was loved. But a jealous monarch couldn't stand it...",
["ascension_story1_3"]="He sent assassins to kill the old man - and awakened the hungry forest! And now the possessed bandits begin their deadly dance for the next victim....",
["ascension_loss1_1"]="Stop! Feel the inner drama of your character: alone against injustice and ancient evil, surrounded by a mad mob... One more time!",
["ascension_win1_1"]="This is justice! The villains are fleeing! The hero sits tiredly on the ground and listens... The forest is asleep again. The curtain falls!",
["ascension_win1_2"]="Live as you play, my friend! With sense and courage! I see I chose the right man. I'll be glad to see you on this stage again. ",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Story_1"]="The moon whispers of great trouble. She seeks your home, Shadow, to breed with you. Do not choose between the two worlds, or you will destroy them all.",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Story_2"]="It is not proper, sir, to make threats to strangers. Leave our house, it's a holiday and you'd better give candy to the children.",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Story_3"]="I hear the murmur of lost souls whispering the word - twins. They will be free! And Shadow will ruin it all, I can't let that happen.",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Story_4"]="You're not the first visitor to bring us bad news, and I'm sure you won't be the last. There are no twins here! Go away, or else...",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Story_5"]="Let it be so. If my words are incomprehensible to you, I will explain in a language you understand.",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Lose_1"]="Forgive me, but I have no choice. You will stay here tonight. She has ordered me to keep you here under penalty of death, and I cannot disobey.",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Lose_2"]="No evil force can imprison the hero! Not tonight, not any night! Rise, Shadow!",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Win_1"]="He didn't look like a villain.... He seemed to be tormented by a force that whispered terrible thoughts to him. Who were these \"twins\" he was talking about?",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Win_2"]="Not a clue. But you and I know a cheeky fellow who knows all the shady characters in this land.",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Win_3"]="Are you sure, Sensei? Every time Sly makes things worse... ",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Win_4"]="As our guest correctly pointed out, there's no other choice. I'll regret this, but let's find the trickster. I hear he deals with dangerous people.",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Story_6"]="I will not dig my own grave! Let's calm down and settle this like professionals! I didn't steal anything, I borrowed it! Stop, stop, stop!",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Story_7"]="And why am I not surprised? Shadow, help the poor guy, please, or these aggressive gentlemen will bury our answers!",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Lose_3"]="These bandits won't leave without what the Sly stole from them! Get up, Shadow, or one hole becomes four!",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Win_5"]="What a bunch of savages! They don't know how to do business! Thanks for your help, but I could've dealt with these idiots myself.",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Win_6"]="And how's that? Digging three meters down instead of two? We only intervened because we need your help! Take care of your \"business\" yourself...",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Win_7"]="Have you heard of twins, Sly? They're supposed to bring a lot of trouble when the web of worlds thins out and gives them their freedom. Who are they?",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Win_8"]="Maybe not \"who\" but \"what\"? I \"borrowed\" a curious knife from the boss of these gentlemen. A friend of mine would pay a fortune for it. She has a second one.",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Win_9"]="Come on! The night is coming to an end, we're wasting time! Perhaps your friend can shed some light on its dark purpose.",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Story_8"]="Who goes there?! Magic whispers to me of your coming. Come in peace! Sorrowful souls will not touch you unless I want them to!",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Story_9"]="Honey, give us a break. Leave your fairy tales to the gullible fools who believe in your \"mystical\" powers. I know who you really are.",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Story_10"]="Oh, it's you, Sly. Why do you scare me like that? Did you bring what I asked for? Yes... I can feel it on you! Give it to me now!",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Story_11"]="Wait, something's wrong. It's like these knives are reaching for each other! We shouldn't have come here! The stranger was right!",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Story_12"]="I hear them! The souls speak to me! No one will ever say I'm a fra-a-a-ud again! Stop, no, I've changed my mind! Let me go, let me go!",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Lose_4"]="Lie still, hero. Your soul will be better off with us. There is no pain, no sickness, only pure fury!",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Lose_5"]="Rise, Shadow, or a legion of damned souls will tear the veil between the world of the living and the world of the dead! ",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Win_10"]="Well, like I said... Where Sly shows up, someone's bound to get hurt...",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Win_11"]="I didn't know! I really didn't! Why did I steal that knife? I'll just give it back, yes! Maybe they'll spare me. Won't they?! Whisper, girl...",
["dlgEvent_HW24_Win_12"]="She needs to rest. I don't know if we've been able to contain the spirits, but the sun is about to rise. And with it, hope is born.",
["WEAPON_DAGGERS_HW_24"]="Loa Twins",
["EventChestHW24"]="Spirit Trap",
