["dlg_NY25_Story_1"]="Welcome! This cabin once belonged to my family. So many memories. Stay as long as you want! There's everything you need to relax. ",
["dlg_NY25_Story_2"]="But you've put us in danger so many times, and now you're offering to stay at the family home? Is this some kind of trick?",
["dlg_NY25_Story_3"]="Just the voice of conscience! I've realized that I've been taking advantage of other people's kindness too much. But now I want to do good.",
["dlg_NY25_Story_4"]="We're not alone... There are people gathering in front of the hut. What do they want at this late hour? They're calling for us to come out.",
["dlg_NY25_Story_5"]="Don't! Phantoms will destroy you! They're just ghosts of painful memories. The forest spirit has come for his chest! Let's get it back!",
["dlg_NY25_Story_6"]="A chest? That's why people are disappearing in the woods! Why did you betray us, Sly? We'd have helped you in this noble quest anyway!",
["dlg_NY25_Story_7"]="You don't understand. If I hear her voice, I'll lose control and I'll be gone too. And as long as I have a piece of her with me.",
["dlg_NY25_Story_8"]="Open the door, I'm freezing in here, daddy. The house is cold, I'm not inside. I'll show you a place where we can be together again.",
["dlg_NY25_Story_9"]="Stop! Don't go into the forest, you'll get lost!! I don't know whose voice you hear, but it's definitely not human!",
["dlg_NY25_Loose_1"]="Your memories are vivid, grief and selfishness speak louder than words. You'll stay here with me. Wait a while, sleep will come soon.",
["dlg_NY25_Loose_2"]="People shouldn't have to pay with their lives for memories! That's what gives them meaning and drives them! Stop this injustice, Shadow!",
["dlg_NY25_Win_1"]="Wake up, Sly! Return the chest to the spirit while it's weak. Let it see that humanity can overcome its greed.",
["dlg_NY25_Win_2"]="Theodore doesn't give everything back. Doesn't want to give back his daughter's ring. Give it back. People's memories come at a high price.",
["dlg_NY25_Win_3"]="I haven't heard that name in a long time. She's the only one who's ever called me that. I just... can't. It's all I have left of her.",
["dlg_NY25_Win_4"]="Your heart didn't stop with her, Theodore. It still beats. Let the spirits sleep in peace. You will find a new meaning, I promise.",
["dlg_NY25_Win_5"]="Theodore can come over anytime he wants to talk to his daughter. I'll show you her phantom and give you all the time in the world.",
["dlg_NY25_Win_6"]="I'll never set foot here again.... Winter will end one day, but I'll live on.",
["dlg_NY25_Win_7"]="You saved a lot of people today, Theodore. You're a hero. Your daughter would be proud. Come, tell us more about your family.",
["NY25Chest"]="Lost Memory",
["NY25Key"]="Stinging Сold",
