["dlgShurale_Announce"]="Awakened by greedy bandits, the forest spirit is wreaking its revenge on innocents! The creature seeks the stolen casket of memories that housed its ancient magic. Only those whose hearts harbor true sorrow will succeed in quelling the creature's fury. The price, however, will be high...",
["dlgShurale_AnnounceTitle"]="The Price of Patronage",
