["RANGED_AZTEC_24"]="Pain Bound",
["SetUi_VOLCANO_SET_Brief"]="Deal {0} successful hits in a row (opponent blocks do not count) to an opponent to summon a lava puddle underneath them. While standing in it, your opponent cannot block your attacks, which deal increased damage. Your chance of inflicting a critical attack on the opponent is increased, and the damage you receive is reduced by {1}%%.",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Story_1"]="The Sun Cult has a tradition of visiting the birthplace of their great hero once a year. But every time it turns out to be a disaster.....",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Story_2"]="He was born human? How curious. It seems to me that these people do not bring gifts to the village...",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Story_3"]="They leave no stone unturned! They steal cattle from the villagers, destroy crops in a drunken frenzy, smash windows and start fights!",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Story_4"]="But why don't the villagers fight back? This is their land and their legend!",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Story_5"]="They're broken. The hero who gave them hope is gone, and the cultists are doing evil in his name. We must restore hope to the people!",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Story_6"]="Pretend you're here to see if everything is ready for the \"holiday\". And we'll fight! The townspeople will see the cult can be confronted!",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Story_7"]="Well, have it your way... Let me get into character. Hey, kid, how dare you wear our hero's clothes! Go away, we're going to have a feast!",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Story_8"]="I may not be a hero of legend, but his spirit lives in this land! He will guide me in my darkest hour, give me courage! Attack!",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Loose_1"]="No, we must keep fighting! No one would believe a simple farmer could defeat a sinister cult so easily. You must fight with all your might!",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Win_1"]="I didn't expect such speed from a mere man... You almost defeated our favorite! We must punish you as an example to the others...",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Win_2"]="Look at him, m'lord! He'll fight until his last breath! Let's retreat before the whole village comes out to fight, we'll come back later...",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Win_3"]="Everyone in this village is a child of the Sun! A hero! From a simple farmer to a healer, it's not for you to trample on our great heritage!",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Win_4"]="A worthy speech, my friend... I think the villagers can take care of themselves now. Let's give them a chance to be heroes.",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Win_5"]="Thank you, my friends. What a play we put on! For a moment, I felt like a hero myself. I'm no longer ashamed to wear these clothes.",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Win_6"]="It's not the clothes that make you a hero, it's you. If the cultists come here again, they'll be in for a nasty surprise. ",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_Announce"]="Immerse yourself in the story of a past hero, separate truth from fiction, and help create a new legend! Fight back against a mysterious cult that uses the name of a great hero of the past as an excuse for their atrocities! Return to the place where it all began and help a fugitive rascal find his true heroism! ",
["dlg_CHN_NY25_AnnounceTitle"]="Solar crown",
