["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_Story_1"]="I have to keep moving, I can't stop! He's watching. No, not like that. Foot here, arm swing, lunge. Get out of my head!",
["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_Story_2"]="What a graceful dance! I've heard of it - it's called Bhangra. Farmers do it in honor of the New Year. ",
["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_Story_3"]="Something's not right. Look at him, he's as green as bamboo! Dancing should be a joy, not a torture. What has poor Sitaram done?",
["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_Story_4"]="Stand back or he'll get in your head too! I've been jumping around like a rag doll for a whole day, and the monster can't get enough! I can't resist its will!",
["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_Story_5"]="Do you owe me a debt, mortal? You summoned me, remember? No one can save you this time, so dance! Let me taste your pain!",
["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_Story_6"]="Agni knows I've paid my dues! Friends, stop this crazy dance, I can't feel my feet anymore!",
["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_Loose_1"]="You're as pathetic a fighter as that little boy is a dancer. What if the two of you performed a duet? And the old man and the girl will applaud! Delicious!",
["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_Loose_2"]="Don't listen to him, Shadow! Show this beast what true Bhangra is! Every battle is a dance. Be the one to set the rhythm!",
["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_Win_1"]="I've never seen you move like that before, Shadow! Where did you learn these moves? Will you teach me?",
["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_Win_2"]="No, stop! No more dancing! No more dancing! It's like eating fresh ashes.",
["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_Win_3"]="Don't you like it, evil spirit? It's the bitter taste of defeat. Remember it, for no one is afraid of you anymore!",
["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_Win_4"]="Thanks friends, I thought I was done for... Please stay for the party! The people will be happy! Let Shadow teach us how to dance!",
["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_Announce"]="The beautiful tradition that marks the beginning of a new year has turned into a nightmare! A wicked prank by a malevolent spirit has caused people to dance until their last breath! Take part in a dangerous dance battle, where every careless move leads to disaster, and free the peasants from the demonic curse.",
["dlg_Vaisakhi_25_AnnounceTitle"]="Dance of Doom",
