["dlg_American_25_Story_1"]="May is gone! Taken by something barely human. But strange - no screams, no signs of struggle… as if she left on her own.",
["dlg_American_25_Story_2"]="We’re not alone in this. Others like May - young, strong - vanished too. She sensed it coming… and filled her pockets with gunpowder.",
["dlg_American_25_Story_3"]="Her trail’s clear. We must find her before the rains come, or it’ll vanish for good! Come, Shadow!",
["dlg_American_25_Story_4"]="I smelled you the moment you stepped on this cursed soil. Why come? To trample my grief? You have no honor - just like they did.",
["dlg_American_25_Story_5"]="I knew you'd show up, shaman. Give the children back to their kin - and our friend to us. Then go rot on your mountain of ash.",
["dlg_American_25_Story_6"]="Ashes to ashes. And to ash you shall return, mortal…",
["dlg_American_25_Loose_1"]="You don’t know who you protect, Shadow. They won’t thank you. Just sneer behind your back. Savages… And I’m the monster?",
["dlg_American_25_Loose_2"]="Whatever these peasants did, their children shouldn't pay the price! Get up, Shadow!",
["dlg_American_25_Win_1"]="Wait! I went with him willingly! His form is beastly, yes - but his heart is human. And it suffers… They stole his child!",
["dlg_American_25_Win_2"]="I smell her on you, girl! Faint, but a father knows. You crossed paths - and now I know where to search.",
["dlg_American_25_Win_3"]="And the children? What have they ever done to you?",
["dlg_American_25_Win_4"]="I wanted the fools to feel a parent’s grief - just for a moment. Their brats will return by dawn, once the trance fades.",
["dlg_American_25_Win_5"]="They made me this way! I healed them, yet they envied and feared me. They took her to break me - yet awakened the beast.",
["dlg_American_25_Win_6"]="Think what you’ll tell her when you meet again. Maybe that thought alone will break the curse.",
["dlg_American_25_AnnounceTitle"]="Sins of the Fathers",
["dlg_American_25_Announce"]="People are vanishing once more - and all signs lead to a man in the shape of a beast, wandering the ruins of a shattered village. Grief has twisted the monster’s soul, and ancient whispers have clouded his mind! Uncover the sorrow that awakened the creature within - and restore lost humanity to the cursed shaman. ",
["WEAPON_ORDERS_OATH_25"]="Order’s Oath",
["HELM_VEIL_OF_DAWN_25"]="Veil of Dawn",
["RANGED_WINDS_HARMONY_25"]="Wind’s Harmony",
