["RANGED_PATH_OF_HERESY_25"]="Path of Heresy",
["summerfest25_story1_1"]="Shadow... I've been challenged to a duel. I haven’t heard words like that in twenty years. And the handwriting? Strange, to say the least.",
["summerfest25_story1_2"]="Something’s not right. I want you to come along - it reeks of a trap.",
["summerfest25_story1_3"]="I knew you’d come, Sensei. The years have taken their toll on us both... But I bet you're just as strong as you used to be.",
["summerfest25_story1_4"]="\"As I used to be\"? Whoever you think I am, you’re mistaken. We’ve never crossed paths, stranger.",
["summerfest25_story1_5"]="No way! Is the Architect scheming against me even here? Or... does this mean he’s afraid I might actually find him?",
["summerfest25_story1_6"]="Oh, and I will. He won’t be able to resist - not when his precious little champion’s life is at stake. Nothing personal, Shadow!",
["summerfest25_story1_defeat_1"]="So… Architect stays in the shadows? And here I thought you would be enough to draw him out.",
["summerfest25_story1_defeat_2"]="Then I’ll make them suffer - every last one you hold dear. Until he shows his pathetic, cowardly face.",
["summerfest25_story1_defeat_3"]="This won’t end with us. If he isn’t stopped now, May will be the next target. You’re the only one who can stop him, Shadow!",
["summerfest25_story1_win_1"]="You fail to see the truth. We’re nothing but playthings to the Architect - and he enjoys watching us break.",
["summerfest25_story1_win_2"]="Everything we’ve lost... every wound we carry - it’s all because of the Architect. We’re just pawns in his sick game.",
["summerfest25_story1_win_3"]="There’s something about you… As if we’ve met before. But if we had, I’m sure I wouldn’t have forgotten you.",
["summerfest25_story1_win_4"]="Shadow, he might be right. We need to track down the Architect and bring him to justice.",
["summerfest25_story2_1"]="Well, well… You’ve been so eager to find me - I figured I’d do you the favor. Besides, everyone was waiting for this moment.",
["summerfest25_story2_2"]="“Everyone”? Stop the act. We know exactly who you are - and how you use others just to revel in their misery.",
["summerfest25_story2_3"]="Just one little cameo and boom - I’m trending! Honestly, I didn’t expect to be this popular.",
["summerfest25_story2_4"]="Your wit won’t save you. You’ll pay - for my eyes, and for all the evil you’ve done. Your twisted game of playing god ends here!",
["summerfest25_story2_5"]="Seriously, Ermine? That kind of talk went out with flip phones. It's 2025 - try to keep up with the times.",
["summerfest25_story2_6"]="Whatever Architect is planning… there’s a darkness around him. A force so malevolent, it’s almost tangible.",
["summerfest25_story2_7"]="With every word he says, I find myself believing Ermine’s story more and more. The Architect is dangerous - and he must be stopped.",
["summerfest25_story2_defeat_1"]="Oh no - how disappointing! The audience expected more. Seems I’ll just have to raise the stakes next time.",
["summerfest25_story2_defeat_2"]="If we don’t win, he’ll drag everyone you know and love into his cruel games! Shadow, you have to keep fighting!",
["summerfest25_story2_win_1"]="Why is the world so cruel? Why must we suffer? Why did I have to blind myself? Answer me, Architect - why does it hurt to live!?",
["summerfest25_story2_win_2"]="Sounds like your own stupidity. You weren’t forced. You weren’t asked. You chose this path yourself. ",
["summerfest25_story2_win_3"]="Yes, the world is harsh. Unforgiving. But in the end, we all choose our path. And you chose yours. Stop blaming others for your own decisions.",
["summerfest25_story2_win_4"]="Until another hot summer day, Shadow. Until a different story entirely. Hope you’re into roleplay. I certainly am.",
["sfest_gift_1"]="Congratulations on Nekki Summer Fest! This blade will help you triumph in every battle to come. Just keep fighting!",
["sfest_gift_2"]="Happy Nekki Summer Fest! These resources are yours - use them to become stronger than ever!",
["SummerFest25Chest"]="Creator's Archive",
["Pile_KeySummerFest25"]="Legacy Key",
["dlg_SummerFest_25_AnnounceTitle"]="Trial of the God",
["dlg_SummerFest_25_Announce"]="The Trial of the God has begun! What if our lives are nothing but lines in someone else's script? Maimed by the will of his creator, a blind warrior walks the path of vengeance. Join him on this harrowing journey and help bring judgment upon the cynical demiurge.",
["WEAPON_SWORD_SUMMER_FEST_25"]="Moon Oath",
["ARMOR_RAID_SUMMER_FEST_25"]="K3vlar",
["HELM_RAID_SUMMER_FEST_25"]="Street Tempest",
["WEAPON_KNUCKLES_RAID_SUMMER_FEST_25"]="Urban Predator",
["HELM_RAID_SUMMER_FEST_26"]="Rh1thm",
["WEAPON_BAT_RAID_SUMMER_FEST_26"]="Imp4ct",
["SFestPart1DefeatPrase_1"]="Not bad! But not enough. Now I see why you’re the Architect’s favorite.",
["SFestPart1DefeatPrase_2"]="I fight for my freedom! One day, you’ll understand.",
["SFestPart1DefeatPrase_3"]="You’ve lost - maybe that’s part of the Architect’s game too? Think about it.",
["SFestPart1DefeatPrase_4"]="Why are you the hero of this story? Why did he choose you?",
["SFestPart1DefeatPrase_5"]="Well, hero? Did you think the Architect expected this plot twist? The protagonist… defeated!",
["SFestPart1WinPrase_1"]="Glorious fight! Now the Architect will definitely notice us.",
["SFestPart1WinPrase_2"]="Strong hit… But trust me, I’ve taken worse. I do what I must. Maybe one day you’ll see.",
["SFestPart1WinPrase_3"]="Fine, you’ve won. But I won’t back down. I have nothing left to lose!",
["SFestPart1WinPrase_4"]="The hero wins… What a cliché plot twist…",
["SFestPart1WinPrase_5"]="I may be blind, but I can clearly see why the Architect chose you. A fine warrior indeed!",
["SFestPart2DefeatPrase_1"]="Did you really think I’d erase myself from my own story?",
["SFestPart2DefeatPrase_2"]="Classic narrative move: the hero meets their god. But in my world, mortals always lose.",
["SFestPart2DefeatPrase_3"]="To feel true drama, the hero must lose… and rethink their life. You’re welcome!",
["SFestPart2DefeatPrase_4"]="I wrote you as persistent, not foolish. Why keep fighting, Shadow? Your fate lies elsewhere. This isn’t your war.",
["SFestPart2DefeatPrase_5"]="Save your enthusiasm for the DLC. Leave before I write you another, sadder ending.",
["SFestPart2WinPrase_1"]="Not bad, Shadow! I really created a strong character. I’m proud of myself!",
["SFestPart2WinPrase_2"]="he hero wins. Predictable - but players love that stuff. I’ll allow it for variety’s sake.",
["SFestPart2WinPrase_3"]="Wait, am I even supposed to lose? It's my script after all! Let me write that the characters ran away in fear.",
["SFestPart2WinPrase_4"]="Stop, Shadow! Someone has to continue this franchise!",
["SFestPart2WinPrase_5"]="You’re just ones and zeros… Where does all that spirit come from? Give me a moment to catch my breath…",
["SUMMER_FEST_25_FIGHT"]="DRAMA",
["SUMMER_FEST_25_FIGHT_TITLE"]="Drama",
