["dlgLetters_Title"]="Cassian's Letter",
["dlgLetters_DailyLimitReached"]="You have collected all available letters for today. Come back tomorrow to continue your search.",
["dlgLetters_DailyLimitRefreshed"]="A new day has dawned. It is time to resume the search for Cassian's lost letters.",
["dlgMidAutumn26_Daily_Gift"]="The city is slowly returning to peaceful life. Grateful residents bring you small gifts in appreciation for your help.",
["dlgMidAutumn26_Daily_Reminder"]="Life is slowly returning to normal on one side of the river. People on the other bank still need help. Help them - and they will reward you.",
["dlgMidAutumn26_Daily_Gift_FirstDialog"]="Keep helping the people of the city. In gratitude for your help, they will bring you valuable gifts.",
["dlgMidAutumn26_EventStageChanged"]="The Moon has entered a new phase. The brothers have grown stronger and are now more dangerous than before. Be careful!",
["RAIDBOSS_BROTHER_DEATH"]="VALERIAN",
["RAIDBOSS_BROTHER_OPULENCE"]="PROSPERO",
["MAFEST26_TOWER_FOE"]="Rebel",
["midautumn26_story_L_reward"]="\"My children, for centuries our family has kept a ceremonial sword, a symbol of resilience in adversity. It is in my chambers. Find it in your darkest hour.\"",
["midautumn26_letters_story_3"]="Looks like the pages scattered across the city while we fought the brothers. Maybe the letter explains what's happening to Cassian's sons. Let's find the pages!"}
